WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.442
In the year 1851, a major event took place in Guangxi.

00:00:03.442 --> 00:00:07.108
Hong Xiuquan led the common people and established the Taiping Heavenly Kingdom.

00:00:07.108 --> 00:00:11.083
Everyone believed that following him would bring good days.

00:00:11.083 --> 00:00:14.700
Many poor farmers joined them one after another.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.032
The army held its banners high and marched north all the way.

00:00:18.032 --> 00:00:21.740
Their army grew stronger day by day.

00:00:21.864 --> 00:00:25.336
In the year 1853, they captured Nanjing.

00:00:25.336 --> 00:00:28.133
They made Nanjing their capital.

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:31.125
On the other side, Zeng Guofan organized an army to resist.

00:00:31.125 --> 00:00:35.083
The two armies faced off against each other, and the war lasted for many years.

00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:39.083
The lamps in the military tents often burned late into the night.

00:00:39.083 --> 00:00:43.083
Many fields lay in ruin, and the common people were displaced from their homes.

00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:46.135
In the year 1864, the Qing army captured Nanjing.

00:00:46.135 --> 00:00:49.125
In the distance, the city of Nanjing was shrouded in smoke.

00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:51.568
The regime of the Taiping Heavenly Kingdom thus came to an end.

00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:55.477
This was one of the largest upheavals of the modern era.
